# Git

Do

- Leave commits and pushes to the user unless they explicitly ask for that action in the current request.
- Stage only files they asked to change, when they do ask to commit.

Don’t

- Auto-commit, amend, or push.
- Create PRs/MRs unless they explicitly ask.
- Rewrite history or force-push.
